    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Thank you for the opportunity to present this proposal on behalf of the Chicago Bears Football Club. Since 1920, this franchise has stood at the center of Chicago sports, and the partners who stand with us share in one of the most recognized brands in American professional football. This document outlines a partnership program designed specifically for {{AccountName}}, combining premium hospitality at Soldier Field, in-stadium brand visibility, and year-round engagement with our organization.",
      "space_after_pt": 10,
      "line_spacing": 1.35
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The pages that follow describe the full scope of the proposed program, the investment summary generated directly from your quote in our system, and the commercial terms that govern the agreement. Every figure in the investment summary reflects the configuration we discussed.{{#ExpirationDate}} The proposal remains valid through {{ExpirationDate}}.{{/ExpirationDate}}",
      "space_after_pt": 10,
      "line_spacing": 1.35
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We built this program around what your team told us matters most: meaningful client hospitality, brand presence in front of a passionate fan base, and a partner relationship that extends beyond ten Sundays a season. We are confident the program delivers on all three, and we look forward to refining any element of it with you.",
      "space_after_pt": 10,
      "line_spacing": 1.35
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On behalf of the entire organization, thank you for considering a partnership with the Chicago Bears. Bear Down.",
