    {
      "_comment": "===== PAGE 3 WHY PARTNER =====",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Why partner with the Chicago Bears",
      "level": 1,
      "size_pt": 22,
      "color": "#0B162A",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "space_before_pt": 0,
      "underline_rule": {
        "color": "#C83803",
        "thickness_pt": 2.25,
        "space_pt": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Chicago Bears are a charter franchise of the National Football League and one of the most storied organizations in professional sports, with nine league championships and more than a century of continuous play. The club's home at Soldier Field sits on Chicago's lakefront and hosts one of the most loyal fan bases in the league, with season ticket waitlists that span generations of Chicago families.",
      "space_after_pt": 10,
      "line_spacing": 1.35
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A corporate partnership with the Bears places your brand inside that relationship. Partners gain access to premium spaces on game day, brand placement across in-stadium media, and hospitality moments that are difficult to replicate anywhere else in the market. Just as importantly, partners work with a dedicated partnerships team year-round, from training camp in the summer through the end of the season, so the program keeps producing value well beyond the home schedule.",
      "space_after_pt": 14,
      "line_spacing": 1.35
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "What a partnership includes",
      "level": 2,
      "size_pt": 14,
      "color": "#0B162A",
      "space_after_pt": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Each program is configured to the partner's objectives, and the specific elements included in this proposal are itemized in the investment summary. Across our partner portfolio, programs typically draw from four categories:",
      "space_after_pt": 8,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u25aa  Premium hospitality, including executive suite licenses and club level season tickets at Soldier Field.",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u25aa  In-stadium brand visibility, including LED ribbon board rotations and tunnel placements on game days.",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u25aa  Money-can't-buy experiences, including training camp visits, player and alumni appearances, and behind-the-scenes access.",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u25aa  Year-round hospitality credits and event access that extend the relationship across the full calendar.",
      "space_after_pt": 10,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sections that follow describe each element of a typical partner program. Line-level pricing for {{AccountName}} appears in the investment summary.",
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "page_break"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "===== PAGE 4 PROGRAM =====",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Your proposed program",
      "level": 1,
      "size_pt": 22,
      "color": "#0B162A",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "space_before_pt": 0,
      "underline_rule": {
        "color": "#C83803",
        "thickness_pt": 2.25,
        "space_pt": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Executive suite at Soldier Field",
      "bold": true,
      "size_pt": 13,
      "color": "#C83803",
      "space_after_pt": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Your program includes a licensed executive suite for the full 2026 home schedule, covering all preseason and regular season games. The suite accommodates your guests in a private, climate-controlled environment with dedicated attendant service, premium in-suite catering access, and VIP parking passes for game day. Suites are the anchor of most partner programs because they turn ten home dates into ten owned hospitality events, hosted in one of the most recognizable venues in American sports.",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Your partnerships manager will coordinate suite logistics for each game, including guest lists, catering pre-orders, and parking distribution, so your team can focus on the guests rather than the operations.",
      "space_after_pt": 12,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Club level season tickets",
      "bold": true,
      "size_pt": 13,
      "color": "#C83803",
      "space_after_pt": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Club level seating places your guests in padded seats with access to climate-controlled concourses, upgraded food and beverage options, and dedicated entry gates. Club seats work alongside a suite as overflow hospitality, or as a standalone program for partners who want a consistent game day presence with a smaller footprint. Tickets are delivered digitally and can be reassigned game by game through your account.",
      "space_after_pt": 12,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In-stadium brand visibility",
      "bold": true,
      "size_pt": 13,
      "color": "#C83803",
      "space_after_pt": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Your brand appears in LED ribbon board rotations during every home game, with creative displayed at moments of peak attention throughout the game experience. Tunnel LED placements on game days put your brand alongside the team as players take the field. All creative is produced to Bears brand and broadcast standards, and our team works with yours on asset production, scheduling, and proof-of-performance reporting after each game.",
      "space_after_pt": 12,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Experiences and hospitality credit",
      "bold": true,
      "size_pt": 13,
      "color": "#C83803",
      "space_after_pt": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Your program includes a hospitality credit applied against in-suite catering and beverage orders across the season, plus a training camp VIP experience at Halas Hall for your guests, with private practice viewing and a hosted reception. These elements are where partnerships become memorable. A morning at training camp or a hosted moment before kickoff regularly becomes the touchpoint your clients talk about for the rest of the year.",
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "page_break"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "===== PAGE 5 PARTNERSHIP MGMT =====",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Partnership management",
      "level": 1,
      "size_pt": 22,
      "color": "#0B162A",
      "space_after_pt": 6,
      "space_before_pt": 0,
      "underline_rule": {
        "color": "#C83803",
        "thickness_pt": 2.25,
        "space_pt": 0
