    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Every partner is assigned a dedicated manager on the corporate partnerships team. Your manager owns fulfillment across all program elements, provides mid-season and end-of-season recaps, and serves as your single point of contact for anything involving the club. Partners also receive first right of discussion on renewals and on new inventory as it becomes available.",
