    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Validity. This proposal and the pricing herein are valid through {{#ExpirationDate}}{{ExpirationDate}}{{/ExpirationDate}}. After that date, pricing and inventory availability are subject to reconfirmation by the Chicago Bears Football Club.",
      "space_after_pt": 8,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Agreement. This proposal is a summary of commercial intent and does not itself create a binding obligation. The partnership becomes effective upon execution of a master partnership agreement between {{AccountName}} and the Chicago Bears Football Club, which will incorporate the program elements and pricing set out in the investment summary.",
      "space_after_pt": 8,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Taxes and fees. Prices exclude applicable federal, state, and local taxes, amusement taxes, and venue fees, which will be itemized on invoices where applicable.",
      "space_after_pt": 8,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inventory. Suite locations, seat locations, and media inventory are assigned at contracting and remain subject to league and venue requirements. The club will consult the partner before any substitution and will provide inventory of equal or greater value if a substitution is required.",
      "space_after_pt": 8,
      "line_spacing": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Confidentiality. The pricing and program structure in this proposal are confidential to {{AccountName}} and the Chicago Bears Football Club and may not be shared with third parties without written consent.",
